              <p class="font-semibold text-white">Here is your laser-focused playbook for deconstructing the Claude Plugin hype and closing deals in 2026.</p>
              <hr class="border-gray-800" />
              <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-300 uppercase tracking-wide">🎯 Understanding the Threat: What Are Claude Plugins?</h5>
